window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>SO, YOU FALL IN LOVE WITH A CYBORG: WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?</p> <p>This second exciting installment of the award-winning Heartless Series will delight lovers of romance and sci-fi adventures. Perfect for fans of Kaliane Bradley, Hugh Howey, and Becky Chambers.</p> <p>Earth, 2050. Pregnant, unemployed, and living back home with her father, scientist Quinn Buyers wonders how she got to this point. Her famous scientist mother is still mysteriously missing. The planet is at risk from a massive solar storm, and the pesky Transhumans want to take a colony to Titan. As if that weren’t enough, her assisted living companion, a robotic meerkat, is depressed. But her biggest challenge is her partner. How can she reconcile her long-distance relationship with this reserved, enigmatic cyborg?</p> <p>This time, Quinn’s adventures take her across the globe to Antarctica . . . where it rains all day, every day. Full of humor and whimsy, Nostalgia Is Heartless will delight listeners as they follow Quinn’s race to save her planet and—hopefully—her love life.</p>"; 
